  "interpretation_notes": [
    "At fixed Delta_t pairing weakens with increasing U in this parameter set (|Delta_S|(V=1.5): U40 > U75 > U115).",
    "Delta_0 sign changes (s+-type relative-sign reorganization of the harmonics) occur only for U/t=40 (Delta_t=3.5, 4.5) and U/t=75, Delta_t=6.0 -- see Delta0_sign_change_V per combo.",
    "For U/t=115, Delta_t=3.5 (and 4.5) pairing collapses to mesh resolution at low V_SO: exact roots become |Delta|~1e-4 (unpaired points) and below V~0.9 (3.5) the T=0 number equation hits its finite-mesh residual floor (<=2.5e-4, flagged mesh_floor_points); Delta_spec there measures min_k|eps-mu| of the normal state (mesh-limited).",
    "min_k|Delta_k| = 0 where the extended-s harmonic crosses zero (nodal/s+- lines); plot values < 1e-4 are clipped in the log-scale panel (c)."
